  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, speed of sound, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Length of open organ pipe,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Frequency, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math><br />For open organ pipe,</p><p>Fundamental frequency, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Number of tones present in the open organ pipe<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1200</mn><mn>85</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>"
